== Description ==

The '''Mechanical Workbench''' builds vehicle parts and mechanical assemblies. It defines 12 raw recipe entries (12 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Bicycle Generator]], [[Driver's Seat]], [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Flexible Rotor]], [[Laser Trap]], [[MechPlatform]], [[Rotating Blade]], [[Rotating Circular Saw]], plus 4 more.

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.MechanicalWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Mechanical</code>.

